/*
  Bathroom Music Controller v2.0
  Hardware: ESP32 DevKit, LDR analog output on GPIO34, DFPlayer Mini
  DFPlayer TX -> ESP32 GPIO16; ESP32 GPIO17 -> 1k resistor -> DFPlayer RX
  DFPlayer DAC_L/DAC_R -> AUX TIP/RING1; GND -> AUX SLEEVE
  DFPlayer VCC -> ESP32 VIN/5V; common GND.

  SD card folders: /01, /02, /03. Tracks named 001.mp3, 002.mp3, etc.
  Search works from SONGS catalogue below; edit titles/counts to match your card.
  Install: ESP32 board support + DFRobotDFPlayerMini library.
